{"obsah":"<p>An outdoor exhibition in February? This year we kicked off the outdoor exhibition season really early, because a pig feast without bikes just isn't possible. Vlasta, Lukáš Valný and Matouš Balík headed for the beautiful little town of Janovice nad Úhlavou. </p>\n\n<p>The weather was literally a lottery. Rain and freezing temperatures a few days before an exhibition make every Trial rider a bit nervous. Anyway, 12 degrees and partly cloudy in February with a great audience was our reward. A bit of wind was no problem and we rode a solid 30-minute show in front of an amazing crowd. As a reward there was a bit of the pig feast. Thanks for the invitation.</p>\n\n<p>---</p>\n\n<p>In 2023 too we put together a group of enthusiasts who wanted to try Trial and gain some experience for the coming season. January was marked by illness and other work, so we only started in February. What was special about the course this time wasn't so much the skill of the participants – who battled with their habits and the Trial bike like their lives depended on it – but the make-up of the riders. Friday was made up purely of men and Saturday, by contrast, purely of women and girls. Hopefully everyone gained something from it and lost nothing.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F02%2FJanovice2.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F02%2FJanovice2.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-231370\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F02%2FJanovice3.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F02%2FJanovice3.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-231372\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F02%2FJanovice1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F02%2FJanovice1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-231371\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F02%2FIMG_0442.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F02%2FIMG_0442.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-231374\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F02%2FIMG_0443.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F02%2FIMG_0443.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-231376\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F02%2FIMG_0444.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F02%2FIMG_0444.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-231375\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F02%2FJanovice4.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapi